.TH SWAPON 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
swapon \- enables swap on a file or device; requires cap_sys_admin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/swap.h>
.B int swapon(const char* path, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enables swap on a file or device; requires CAP_SYS_ADMIN.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR swapon (2)
